    'Root owns bounded physical stdout/stderr capture for any later diagnostic run. The logical65536-byte report bound, Source-only verdict and six unrun control plans supply no OS/Job/whole-host/capture/READY/GO/runtime/science proof. External full P16/Binder17 and future BoundPool20 delegation remain precise.', '',
